---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
const tracking = !!(SITE.ga4Id || SITE.adsenseClient);
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How DistritoGamer handles your data: what we collect, how cookies, analytics and advertising work, and the rights you have over your information." path="/privacy-policy/" updated="2026-10-06"
  intro="What information we collect, why, and the choices you have.">
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>This policy applies to {SITE.domain} (&ldquo;{SITE.name}&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;). You can reach us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> or through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you give us</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact messages:</strong> your name, email address and message when you contact us.</li>
    <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> your email address if you subscribe. We use it only to send the newsletter and can remove it on request.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <p>Our hosting provider and content delivery network process standard technical data, such as IP address, browser type and requested pages, to serve the site securely and reliably.</p>
  <h2 id="cookies">Cookies, analytics and advertising</h2>
  <p>The site works without cookies. We may use two optional services, and neither loads until you click <strong>Accept</strong> in our cookie notice:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Analytics</strong> (Google Analytics 4) to understand which guides are useful, using aggregated data and IP anonymization.</li>
    <li><strong>Advertising</strong> (Google AdSense) to show ads that help fund the site. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve and measure ads. You can learn how Google uses data from sites that use its services at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a> and manage ad personalization at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">adssettings.google.com</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you click <strong>Decline</strong>, these services are not loaded. We store your choice in your browser&rsquo;s local storage so we do not ask again on every page.{tracking ? ' You can change your choice at any time:' : ''}</p>
  {tracking && <p><button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-consent-reset>Change cookie preferences</button></p>}
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you click an affiliate link, the merchant or affiliate network may set cookies to attribute a purchase to us. We do not receive your payment details. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To answer your messages and send requested newsletters.</li>
    <li>To keep the site secure, prevent abuse and fix technical problems.</li>
    <li>To understand aggregate usage and improve our guides (only with your consent for analytics cookies).</li>
    <li>To show advertising (only with your consent for advertising cookies).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information for money, and we do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We share information only with service providers who help us operate the site (hosting, email delivery, analytics and advertising if enabled), when required by law, or to protect our rights and users. Those providers process data under their own terms and privacy policies.</p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>We keep contact messages for as long as needed to respond and for a reasonable period afterward. Newsletter addresses are kept until you unsubscribe. Analytics and advertising data are retained according to the providers&rsquo; settings.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live (for example California, other US states, the UK or the EU), you may have the right to access, correct, delete or port your personal information, to object to or restrict certain processing, and to opt out of the sale or sharing of personal information for targeted advertising. We honor these rights where they apply. To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>. We may need to verify your identity first.</p>
  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>The site is served over HTTPS. No system is perfectly secure, but we limit the data we collect and share precisely so there is less to protect.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>Our guides link to other websites. We are not responsible for their content or privacy practices.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy we will update the date at the top. Material changes will be highlighted on this page.</p>
</PageLayout>
